          "type": "text",
          "text": "A right-angled triangular banner hangs from a stage rail. It has perpendicular sides 88 cm and 105 cm. Calculate the hypotenuse c in centimetres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "primary_outcome": "4.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
